            "review_title": "Review at Romaro Halal Express Saigon",
            "review_text": "Bo J\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam15 contributions\n1\nMiddle East Food Hidden Gem in Saigon\nMar 2021\nWe visited Romaro Halal Saigon by chance, as we were going to another middle eastern food restaurant nearby , but it was completely full.\nThe place is nice, cool and clean. there was only 2 guests in the restaurant when we came in. they told us that the food was great, cheap and huge portion . \nSo we did ordered the same dishes than them, and they were absolutely right, food great , served fast by the friendly owner Mr Ali From Jordan .It was the most nice food experience i had in years in Saigon . We will go again soon ! Romaro Halal Saigon is a great place to eat Middle Eastern food .\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2021",
